    "detailed_description": "Emergency in Space is 3D game about survival on damaged spaceship.<br />\r\nYou are the sole survivor aboard an abandoned space ship, lost in the vastness of space. <br />\r\nSilence reigns around you, with the sounds of cosmic waves and the echoes of the ship's systems. Your mission is to survive. <br />\r\nThe ship is losing air rapidly due to a breach, and you have little time to find a way to seal it, restore vital systems, and send an SOS signal. <br />\r\nUse limited resources, tools, and your wit to combat loneliness and chaos. <br />\r\nTime is against you, and every decision you make could be crucial.<br />\r\n Your fate now lies in the boundless cosmos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features: <br />\r\nIntense Gameplay: Race against time and elements in search of solutions. <br />\r\nDecision-Making: Choose between urgent repairs. <br />\r\nAtmosphere: Full immersion in the atmosphere of hopelessness, loneliness, and despair against the backdrop of the limitless space. <br />\r\nGraphics: 3D",
